<title>FRANCE: Highlights of ONIC maize estimates.</title>
<headline>Highlights of ONIC maize estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cereals office ONIC's monthly maize estimates (July/June, million tonnes).</p>
<p>			   96/97(Mar) 96/97 (Feb)     95/96</p>
<p> Opening stocks	 1.647     1.647	     1.671</p>
<p> Harvested crop	14.280    14.212	    12.394</p>
<p> Use on farms	   1.860     1.912	     1.974</p>
<p> Other domestic use   3.736     3.685	     2.971</p>
<p>  - incl. animal feed 2.650     2.600	     1.916</p>
<p> Exports to EU	  6.435     6.000	     6.087</p>
<p> Non-EU exports	 0.120     0.100	     0.164</p>
<p> Final stocks	   2.519     2.825	     1.647</p>
</text>
